@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="dashboard-container privacy-page" id="privacyPage">

    <div class="privacy-hero">
        <span class="tag-pill">Legal</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-hero-sub">Last updated: September 2026 &mdash; FoodBridge Platform</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-content-grid">

        <nav class="privacy-toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
            <p class="toc-heading">On this page</p>
            <ol>
                <li><a href="#section-overview">Overview</a></li>
                <li><a href="#section-data">Data We Collect</a></li>
                <li><a href="#section-use">How We Use It</a></li>
                <li><a href="#section-auth">Authentication &amp; Security</a></li>
                <li><a href="#section-sharing">Data Sharing</a></li>
                <li><a href="#section-rights">Your Rights</a></li>
                <li><a href="#section-contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ol>
        </nav>

        <div class="privacy-body">

            <section id="section-overview" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>1. Overview</h2>
                <p>
                    FoodBridge (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;our&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) is a food-donation coordination
                    platform connecting food donors with receivers in need. We are committed to protecting the
                    privacy and security of all users who register on this platform.
                </p>
                <p>
                    This Privacy Policy explains what personal information we collect, how we use it, and the
                    rights you have regarding your data. By creating an account or using FoodBridge, you agree to
                    the practices described in this policy.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section-data" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
                <p>When you register for FoodBridge, we collect the following information:</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="privacy-list-label">Full Name</span>
                        Used to identify you within the platform and to personalise your dashboard.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="privacy-list-label">Email Address</span>
                        Your primary identifier and the key used to link donations to your account.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="privacy-list-label">Password</span>
                        Stored as a secure bcrypt/ASP.NET Identity hash. We never store plain-text passwords.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="privacy-list-label">Role</span>
                        Whether you are a <em>Donor</em> or a <em>Receiver</em>. This determines which features
                        you can access.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="privacy-list-label">City</span>
                        Used to localise the food network. Helps match donors and receivers in the same area.
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>When you submit a food donation, we also collect:</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li><span class="privacy-list-label">Food Name &amp; Items</span> Description of the donated food.</li>
                    <li><span class="privacy-list-label">Quantity</span> Estimated number of servings.</li>
                    <li><span class="privacy-list-label">Location Details</span> City, state, and specific pickup address.</li>
                    <li><span class="privacy-list-label">Donation Date &amp; Time</span> Recorded automatically when a listing is created.</li>
                    <li><span class="privacy-list-label">Donation Status</span> e.g. &ldquo;pending&rdquo;.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="section-use" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>We use the collected data exclusively to operate the FoodBridge platform:</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li>To authenticate you and issue a secure session token (JWT).</li>
                    <li>To display your food donations on your Donor Dashboard.</li>
                    <li>To display incoming food requests on the Receiver Dashboard.</li>
                    <li>To associate food listings with the correct donor account via email address.</li>
                    <li>To personalise your experience (display name, role-based navigation).</li>
                </ul>
                <p>We do <strong>not</strong> use your data for advertising, profiling, or third-party marketing purposes.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="section-auth" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>4. Authentication &amp; Security</h2>
                <p>
                    FoodBridge uses <strong>JSON Web Tokens (JWT)</strong> for session management. Tokens are signed
                    with a secret key and include an expiry time. Your token is stored locally in your browser and
                    sent with each API request via the <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> header.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Passwords are hashed using ASP.NET Core Identity's <code>PasswordHasher</code> before storage.
                    We do not have access to your plain-text password at any time.
                </p>
                <p>
                    All data is transmitted over HTTPS in production environments.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section-sharing" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
                <p>
                    We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.
                    Food donation details (food name, quantity, location, items) are visible to
                    authenticated users of the platform for the purposes of coordinating food distribution.
                    Your email address is not displayed publicly.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section-rights" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>As a FoodBridge user, you have the right to:</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li>Know what personal data we hold about you.</li>
                    <li>Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
                    <li>Request deletion of your account and associated data.</li>
                    <li>Withdraw consent at any time by ceasing use of the platform.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the details in Section 7.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section-contact" class="privacy-section">
                <h2>7. Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled,
                    please contact the FoodBridge platform administrator.
                </p>
                <div class="privacy-contact-card">
                    <span class="privacy-contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9993;</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong>FoodBridge Platform</strong><br />
                        <span class="text-muted" style="font-size:13px;">
                            For data requests or privacy concerns, reach out via the platform.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>
